 "path": "/2026/05/productos-el-bici.html",
 "titulo": "CERVEZA MICA",
 "fila": null,
 "contenido": "<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgVbJtrNwjpb9kGigw5B5ZvPA5WsyD62TtZfkYtoPwf4WYAsBOZF66QybohHTyhRX9ipoTY04ubsDkkRfiNnuWUaTQBiBatIasKHz_dosBsu0T8IeTlZI4BdJTyKnsWomgNY3uJ4XoodkdhJH297DFdgRmRakZkNao7FHDbLin4IlgrF8UdEnNbMzyfCM8/s1500/ChatGPT_Image_28_abr_2026_17_28_27_e04b6622-d7a2-4fe2-b98c-0df1953bd533.webp\" style=\"display: block; padding: 1em 0px; text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1000\" data-original-width=\"1500\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgVbJtrNwjpb9kGigw5B5ZvPA5WsyD62TtZfkYtoPwf4WYAsBOZF66QybohHTyhRX9ipoTY04ubsDkkRfiNnuWUaTQBiBatIasKHz_dosBsu0T8IeTlZI4BdJTyKnsWomgNY3uJ4XoodkdhJH297DFdgRmRakZkNao7FHDbLin4IlgrF8UdEnNbMzyfCM8/s320/ChatGPT_Image_28_abr_2026_17_28_27_e04b6622-d7a2-4fe2-b98c-0df1953bd533.webp\" width=\"320\" /></a></div><br /><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div>Cerveza Mica es una marca de cerveza artesanal española originaria de la Ribera del Duero. Se caracteriza por una producción cuidada, uso de ingredientes naturales y cervezas de estilo equilibrado, con variedad de perfiles como lager, IPA o tostadas.</div></div><div id=\"tienda-catalogo\"></div>\n\n<div id=\"sentinel\" style=\"height: 1px;\"></div>\n\n<div id=\"loader\" style=\"display: none; padding: 15px; text-align: center;\">\n  Cargando...\n</div>\n\n<style>\n#tienda-catalogo{\n  display:grid;\n  grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(200px,1fr));\n  gap:20px;\n  font-family:Arial;\n}\n\n.producto-card{\n  border:1px solid #eaeaea;\n  padding:15px;\n  border-radius:10px;\n  text-align:center;\n  background:#fff;\n}\n\n.producto-card img{\n  width:100%;\n  height:200px;\n  object-fit:cover;\n  border-radius:8px;\n}\n\n.producto-title{\n  font-size:14px;\n  margin:10px 0;\n  font-weight:600;\n}\n\n.producto-link{\n  display:block;\n  background:#111;\n  color:#fff;\n  padding:10px;\n  text-decoration:none;\n  border-radius:6px;\n  font-size:12px;\n  font-weight:bold;\n}\n</style>\n\n<script>\n\nvar TIENDA_URL = \"https://cervezamica.es/\";\n\nvar APPS_SCRIPT = \"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbwAz-q8cQuhZsdVzfl5bY9my_rzawc1B3lW4b8fAc1jtUgC9ZQcC-lg2iGHp5bq4KM6YQ/exec\";\n\nvar paginaActual = 1;\nvar cargando = false;\nvar hayMas = true;\nvar cola = false;\n\nfunction limpiarUrl(url){\n  return url ? url.replace(/&amp;/g,\"&\").replace(/&apos;/g,\"'\") : \"\";\n}\n\nfunction crearTarjeta(p){\n  return `\n    <div class=\"producto-card\">\n      <img src=\"${limpiarUrl(p.imagen)}\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <div class=\"producto-title\">${p.titulo}</div>\n      <a class=\"producto-link\"\n         href=\"${limpiarUrl(p.url)}\"\n         target=\"_blank\"\n         onclick=\"registrarClic('${p.titulo.replace(/'/g,\"\\\\'\")}','${p.url}','${p.tienda}')\">\n        Comprar\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  `;\n}\n\nasync function cargarProductos(){\n\n  if(cargando || !hayMas) return;\n\n  cargando = true;\n\n  document.getElementById(\"loader\").style.display = \"block\";\n\n  try {\n\n    var res = await fetch(\n      APPS_SCRIPT +\n      \"?tienda=\" + encodeURIComponent(TIENDA_URL) +\n      \"&pagina=\" + paginaActual\n    );\n\n    var data = await res.json();\n\n    var cont = document.getElementById(\"tienda-catalogo\");\n\n    cont.innerHTML += data.productos.map(crearTarjeta).join(\"\");\n\n    hayMas = data.hayMas;\n\n    paginaActual++;\n\n  } catch(e){\n    console.log(e);\n  }\n\n  document.getElementById(\"loader\").style.display = \"none\";\n\n  cargando = false;\n\n  if(cola){\n    cola = false;\n    cargarProductos();\n  }\n}\n\n// 🔥 INFINITE SCROLL\ndocument.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", function(){\n\n  cargarProductos();\n\n  var sentinel = document.getElementById(\"sentinel\");\n\n  var observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n\n    if(entries[0].isIntersecting){\n\n      if(cargando){\n        cola = true;\n        return;\n      }\n\n      cargarProductos();\n    }\n\n  }, { rootMargin: \"250px\" });\n\n  observer.observe(sentinel);\n\n});\n\n// 🔥 TRACKING CORREGIDO (IMPORTANTE)\nasync function registrarClic(titulo, url, tienda){\n\n  try {\n\n    await fetch(APPS_SCRIPT, {\n      method: \"POST\",\n      headers: {\n        \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"\n      },\n      body: JSON.stringify({\n        tienda: tienda,\n        titulo: titulo,\n        url: url\n      }),\n      mode: \"no-cors\"\n    });\n\n  } catch(e){\n    console.log(\"tracking error\", e);\n  }\n}\n\n</script><div><br /></div><a href=\"https://cervezamica.es/\" target=\"_blank\"><b>IR A LA WEB OFICIAL&nbsp;</b></a><div><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span>SI NO ENVÍAN A TU DESTINO CONTÁCTANOS:</span><span>&nbsp;</span><a href=\"mailto:comercialyventas@gmail.com\">comercialyventas@gmail.com</a></span></div>",
 "fecha_copia": "2026-09-26T17:00:01.492Z"
}